Error [E0851]: Module alias `bad_alias` passes 2 argument(s) but `cache` expects 1
  --> tests/ui/genmod_wrong_arg_count.jet:5:1
    |
  5 | module bad_alias :: cache<Int, String>
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The number of type/value arguments must match the template parameter list
 Fix: Example: `module bad_alias :: cache<K>` with 1 arg(s)
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0851
